{title: 688 - Surely, Surely}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #688 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: D}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 688}
{meta: category Sentences and Responses - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[G/D]Surely, [D]surely [G/D]the Lord has [Em]been here,
[A7]Surely [G/D]angels [D]still linger near;
[G/D]I [D]hear music [Em/G]soft [G]on my ear,
[D/A]I [A]feel His [Bm]Spirit,
[A7]Ihave [D]no fear.
{end_of_verse}
